{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"Add a phone to a network this instance owns (ENROLLMENT.md Mode A): picks the next free overlay IP, signs a cert with groups member,phone (+ extras) and a freshly made keypair, records members/<id>/host.crt + info.json (kind phone), and returns the join payload including the private key. The key is never stored here: it is read from a temporary folder that is deleted at once. Refuses when the network has no lighthouse with a public address. Admin-only.\n\nInputs:\n- `servicename` (*string*): network name\n- `device_name` (*string*): the phone's name (also the cert name)\n- `groups` (*string*): extra cert groups, comma separated (may be empty)\n","import":"use flowlang::datastore::DataStore;\nuse ndata::dataarray::DataArray;\nuse std::fs;\nuse std::time::{SystemTime, UNIX_EPOCH};\n\n/// One string field from `nebula-cert print -json` (first occurrence); \"\" if unknown.\nfn nb_cert_json_str(certbin: &std::path::Path, crt: &std::path::Path, key: &str) -> String {\n  let out = std::process::Command::new(certbin).args([\"print\", \"-json\", \"-path\", &crt.display().to_string()]).output();\n  if let Ok(o) = out {\n    let s = String::from_utf8_lossy(&o.stdout).to_string();\n    let pat = format!(\"\\\"{}\\\":\\\"\", key);\n    if let Some(i) = s.find(&pat) {\n      let rest = &s[i + pat.len()..];\n      if let Some(j) = rest.find('\"') { return rest[..j].to_string(); }\n    }\n  }\n  String::new()\n}\n\nfn nb_err(msg: &str, reason: &str) -> DataObject {\n  let mut o = DataObject::new();\n  o.put_string(\"status\", \"err\");\n  o.put_string(\"msg\", msg);\n  if !reason.is_empty() { o.put_string(\"reason\", reason); }\n  o\n}\n\n/// \"host:port\" for a lighthouse address; adds the network's port when missing.\nfn nb_with_port(addr: &str, port: &str) -> String {\n  let a = addr.trim();\n  if a.is_empty() { return String::new(); }\n  if a.starts_with('[') { return if a.contains(\"]:\") { a.to_string() } else { format!(\"{}:{}\", a, port) }; }\n  if a.matches(':').count() == 1 { a.to_string() }\n  else if a.contains(':') { format!(\"[{}]:{}\", a, port) }     // bare IPv6\n  else { format!(\"{}:{}\", a, port) }\n}\n","params":[{"name":"servicename","type":"String"},{"name":"device_name","type":"String"},{"name":"groups","type":"String"}],"returntype":"JSONObject","type":"rust"},"id":"qrxkvt1a2138dd957y1","readers":[],"time":1795624424132,"username":"system","writers":[]}